{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52807","headline":"送贺秘监归会稽诗 · 韦坚","name":"送贺秘监归会稽诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"解印辞荣禄，游真奉德音。\n赠行天藻下，饯席上台临。\n远驭仙山鹤，常怀帝里心。\n无因同执袂，相望但沾襟。\n（《会稽掇英总集》卷二）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦坚","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52807.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52807","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}